# POM2 for RetroArch — the core preset RetroArch loads by itself for POM2
# (Settings > Video > Shaders on, "Auto-load presets" on, the defaults).
# It points at the colour monitor's look. For a monochrome monitor choose
# shaders_slang/pom2/pom2-monochrome.slangp instead, or save your own core
# preset from Quick Menu > Shaders, which takes precedence over this one.
#reference "../../shaders_slang/pom2/pom2-composite.slangp"
